Legislative Hearing on the following bills:

• H.R. 7642 (Rep. Scholten), To reauthorize the Junior Duck Stamp Conservation and Design Program Act of 1994 (16 U.S.C. 719 et seq.); 
• H.R. 9514 (Rep. Boebert), “Finish the Arkansas Valley Conduit Act”;
• H.R. 9515 (Rep. Calvert), “Lower Colorado River Multi-Species Conservation Program Amendment Act of 2024”; and
• H.R. 9969 (Rep. Hageman), To provide for a memorandum of understanding to address the impacts of a certain record of decision on the Upper Colorado River Basin Fund.

